  "title": "Wintrust Financial Corporation Reports Record Quarterly Net Income",
  "summary": "ROSEMONT, Ill., April 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Wintrust Financial Corporation (“Wintrust”, “the Company”, “we” or “our”) (Nasdaq: WTFC) announced record net income of $227.4 million, or $3.22 per diluted common share, for the first quarter of 2026 compared to net income of $223.0 million, or $3.15 per diluted common share for the fourth quarter of 2025. Pre-tax, pre-provision income (non-GAAP) for the first quarter of 2026 totaled a record $330.5 million, as compared to $329.8 million for the",
